    "method": "CIE76 distance in L*a*b*, rounded to a whole number, from each new public color to the nearest of the colors named. packages/design-tokens/test/tokens.test.mjs computes them from the values in this file and fails if one differs. They are numbers, not a judgment of what people confuse: nobody has been asked.",
