    "reading": "Room A, Room B and the Jail share a hue with the Blue, Alien and Red accents, and the Command Room, the captions and the yellow character with the amber of interaction and of the active turn. That is the look the game owner approved; whether it misleads at a table is open (DSN-D13, DSN-D08)."
